# PFP Frontend — архитектура (lanes)

**Индекс:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) · **Runbook партнёра:** [`docs/PARTNER_AI_ONBOARDING.md`](../../docs/PARTNER_AI_ONBOARDING.md)

## Lanes — не смешивать

| Lane | URL | Entry |
|------|-----|-------|
| B2C guest | `/plan` | `main.tsx` → `B2cGuestPlanPage` |
| Landing | `/`, `?page=landing` | `App.tsx` → `LandingPage` |
| Agent LK | `/` после login | `App.tsx` (`?page=list`, …) |
| Sber | `/sber` | `main.tsx` → `SberLandingPage` |
| ATB | `/atb_*` | `main.tsx` → `AtbMassEntryPage` |
| Onboarding | `/invite/activate`, `/register` | `main.tsx` |

Роутинг: **нет react-router**. Public — [`src/routing/publicRoutes.ts`](../../src/routing/publicRoutes.ts).

## API clients

- LK: `agentLkApi.ts`, `clientApi.ts`
- B2C guest: `b2cApi.ts`, `b2cOrchestratorApi.ts`
- Auth: `authApi.ts`
- Key: `projectKey.ts` → `X-Project-Key`

OpenAPI: `api_docs/`. JWT: agent `localStorage.token` ≠ guest `client_token`.

