## Partner handoff

- Ветка clone: **`partner-handoff`** (read-only snapshot)
- **Их фронт → наш API:** `VITE_PARTNER_PROJECT_KEY` — [`docs/PARTNER_PROJECT_KEY_SETUP.md`](../../docs/PARTNER_PROJECT_KEY_SETUP.md)
- Git: [`docs/PARTNER_GIT_ACCESS.md`](../../docs/PARTNER_GIT_ACCESS.md) — партнёрам push **запрещён**
- `/plan/` **со слэшем** на CDN

